SUMMARY:Bull City: Walk & Brew 🍻 
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nWhen I first moved to Durham\, I dro
 ve everywhere downtown like a fool 💀 then I realized this city is actua
 lly mad walkable and all the spots I like are way closer together than the
 y feel in a car.\n\nSo I’m introducing the Bull City Walk & Brew 🍻\n\
 nA roughly 3-mile downtown loop with 3 stops\, good vibes\, a little movem
 ent\, and a chance to actually enjoy the city on foot. We’ll pass by Ame
 rican Tobacco Campus and the Bulls stadium\, then stop at each spot for ab
 out 30 minutes before heading to the next.\n\nThis week’s route:\nDurham
  Central Park → Ponysaurus → Durham Beer Garden → Kotoko Surf Club\n
 \nCome walk\, have a drink\, see downtown\, and pretend we’re the kind o
 f people who do wholesome social activities. (There’s free street parkin
 g downtown on the weekends too!)
